  "definition": "Adjustment Due to Temporary Promotion",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-12-01",
  "expirationDate": "2035-12-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes at chapter heading for Per 100) #8738, eff 10-18-06; amd by #10239, eff 3-18-13; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14439, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35 (formerly Per 901.09)",
